CM_ "open-crank bus contract, Level 1 (docs/bus-interface.md), in machine-readable form. The document is the contract; this file must agree with it (tests/dbc_vectors.c, tools/check_dbc.py). Identifiers carry the nominal source addresses: engine 0x00, machine controller 0x27, bench 0xFC.";
CM_ BO_ 2348810279 "Torque/Speed Control 1, PGN 0, to the engine (0x00), every 10 ms while overriding. Byte 7: counter (SPN 4206) and checksum (SPN 4207, J1939-71), required since v0.3.1.";
CM_ BO_ 2364539904 "Electronic Engine Controller 1, PGN 61444, broadcast, every 10 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 2566843904 "Engine Temperature 1, PGN 65262, every 1000 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 2566844160 "Engine Fluid Level/Pressure 1, PGN 65263, every 500 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 2566834688 "Active diagnostic trouble codes, PGN 65226, every 1000 ms and at once on a change. This is the single-frame layout (lamps and the first DTC). With two codes or more DM1 is longer than 8 bytes and travels as a BAM (TP_CM_BAM, TP_DT): a J1939 reader reassembles it.";
CM_ BO_ 2565668608 "Transport protocol connection management, PGN 60416, to global: the BAM that announces a DM1 longer than 8 bytes.";
CM_ BO_ 2565603072 "Transport protocol data transfer, PGN 60160, to global: the BAM's packets, 50 ms apart, 7 bytes each, the last padded with 0xFF.";
CM_ BO_ 2566856956 "open-crank operator controls (not SAE J1939), PGN 0xFF20, from the bench (0xFC), every 20 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 2365530407 "open-crank hoist pump displacement command (not SAE J1939), PGN 0xFF21, from the controller, every 10 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 2566860540 "Bench only, not part of the bus contract: latency echo request (contract 8, tools/can_rtt.py). Bytes 0-3: a sequence number.";
CM_ BO_ 2566860583 "Bench only, not part of the bus contract: the echo firmware's answer (contract 8), bytes echoed unchanged.";
CM_ BO_ 2566860284 "Bench only, not part of the bus contract: 8 bytes of 0xFF, every step while test.dut_hang is 1. Only the hang-test board build reacts (watchdog test).";
